{title: He is fairer then the lily}

{comment: Chorus}
Lord you are more precious then silver
Lord you are more costly then gold
Lord you are more beautiful then diamonds
Nothing I desire compares to you

{comment: Verse 1}
He is fairer then the lily of the valley
He is brighter then the morning star
He is purer then the snow, fresher then the breeze
Lovelier by far then all of these
